JK4SPEED for PS4

Our own code
------------
The code in this repository (the launcher in launcher/, the title build
scripts in title/, the pre-flight probe in probe/, the profile and
registry templates in templates/ and the tools) is
Copyright (c) 2026 XxXJoker13XxX and contributors, and licensed under the
GNU Lesser General Public License, version 2.1 or (at your option) any
later version. See LICENSES/LGPL-2.1.txt.

Third-party code in this repository
-----------------------------------
launcher/third_party/tweetnacl/: TweetNaCl (Bernstein, Janssen, Lange,
Schwabe, Dempsky, Smetsers), public domain. Two local changes, see its
README.md.

Not in this repository
----------------------
No game files and no Electronic Arts files. No mod files: the Xbox 360
Stuff Pack, the Upscaled HUD and the HD Road Textures are downloaded by
each player from their authors (README.md). The native DXVK client
(d3d9.dll) ships in the package only; see SOURCES.txt and
LICENSES/Native-DXVK.txt.

Name and badge
--------------
The JK4SPEED name, wordmark and icon are not covered by the code licence.
Forks are welcome under the LGPL, but must use their own name and must not
present themselves as official JK4SPEED builds. The "Official Build" badge
is shown only for packages signed with the JK4SPEED release key.

See THIRD_PARTY.md, LICENSES.md and CREDITS.md for everything the package
uses and who made it.
